{"4304540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I MUST FIND HER", "steam_appid": 4304540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>How do I create a location for I MUST FIND HER?!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How do I create a location for I MUST FIND HER?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To maximize the atmosphere of the events of April 1986, I study lot of materials about these events in great details.  <br>Due to the great danger of radiation infection, in an effort to protect people, the authorities asked people to leave the territory of <strong>Pripyat</strong> as soon as possible, allocating the necessary transport for evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is a real photo of the gatherings of the residents of <strong>Pripyat</strong>, who were evacuated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/1729a8424b4c3ea2f6713cff7ee9c7a8.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1268 height=822 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And here is a truck hero will find on one of the sections of the endless road in <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/3c7f0c5a652932cd3c8ac8e211060642.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=709 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/cee652921c24bbc358da4ff8f17ec57c.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=709 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm not doing a documentary project and I'm not trying to do exactly what it looks like in reality. My desire is to convey the feeling of being present among those events, and I really hope that I will succeed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you are interested, please support I MUST FIND HER by adding game to the <u><strong>WISHLIST</strong></u>.</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/360844934cb4fede8ddcd970603d3ab5.avif?t=1780425171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras_big/360844934cb4fede8ddcd970603d3ab5.webp?t=1780425171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Father finds himself in an endless mysterious loop that turns a foggy section of an ordinary Soviet road into the scenery of a real psychological thriller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many people tell stories about the events in <strong>Chernobyl</strong> after the disaster, but no one talked about what happened to ordinary people - residents of the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/2808713fff97837cd57aed31225bacf8.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <u><strong>story</strong></u> is based on real events, and the player is immersed in the events of one of the most mysterious incidents of the last century - <strong>Chernobyl Events</strong>, getting a chance to hear real radio reports about the tragic episodes of those days, and also be able to understand what motivates the hero, where his daughter disappeared and experience for yourself what it was like for the residents of the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>, who had to evacuate and leave their homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/425ee13b9b72adec2f2ee8d584feff28.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.poster.avif?t=1780425171\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.webm?t=1780425171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.mp4?t=1780425171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > deep first—person view promotes exciting immersion into the world of <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> - sounds, movements, and interaction with the world are recreated as realistically as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-standard loop mechanics of creating a loop on a blocked road section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > find out how works mysterious road loop, that the main character is trapped in,  and look for ways to break its rules and try to leave;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >study real radio recordings, newspapers and posters from that period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interact with almost everything you see on the road, find clues and ways to understand what happened to the hero, his daughter and the world around them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> you will not find standard puzzles, all solutions are intuitive and understandable, but require logical reflection and a deep dive into the plot and the fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/0d284b3e11f6413646055cd807cdd9ca.avif?t=1780425171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras_big/0d284b3e11f6413646055cd807cdd9ca.webp?t=1780425171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recreate the most realistic atmosphere of the events of the evacuation of the city of Pripyat, several hours of real-life negotiations between dispatchers of the <strong>Chernobyl</strong> power plant, as well as fire brigades, have been added to the game.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WISHLIST</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out more about what really happened in April 1986 in the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>. And don't forget to add <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> to your <u><strong>WISHLIST</strong></u> to keep up to date with the news about the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/360844934cb4fede8ddcd970603d3ab5.avif?t=1780425171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras_big/360844934cb4fede8ddcd970603d3ab5.webp?t=1780425171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Father finds himself in an endless mysterious loop that turns a foggy section of an ordinary Soviet road into the scenery of a real psychological thriller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many people tell stories about the events in <strong>Chernobyl</strong> after the disaster, but no one talked about what happened to ordinary people - residents of the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/2808713fff97837cd57aed31225bacf8.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <u><strong>story</strong></u> is based on real events, and the player is immersed in the events of one of the most mysterious incidents of the last century - <strong>Chernobyl Events</strong>, getting a chance to hear real radio reports about the tragic episodes of those days, and also be able to understand what motivates the hero, where his daughter disappeared and experience for yourself what it was like for the residents of the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>, who had to evacuate and leave their homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/425ee13b9b72adec2f2ee8d584feff28.avif?t=1780425171\" width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.poster.avif?t=1780425171\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.webm?t=1780425171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/b016be800becab1e6ef04e6fbc15d937.mp4?t=1780425171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > deep first—person view promotes exciting immersion into the world of <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> - sounds, movements, and interaction with the world are recreated as realistically as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-standard loop mechanics of creating a loop on a blocked road section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > find out how works mysterious road loop, that the main character is trapped in,  and look for ways to break its rules and try to leave;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >study real radio recordings, newspapers and posters from that period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interact with almost everything you see on the road, find clues and ways to understand what happened to the hero, his daughter and the world around them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> you will not find standard puzzles, all solutions are intuitive and understandable, but require logical reflection and a deep dive into the plot and the fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras/0d284b3e11f6413646055cd807cdd9ca.avif?t=1780425171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/extras_big/0d284b3e11f6413646055cd807cdd9ca.webp?t=1780425171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recreate the most realistic atmosphere of the events of the evacuation of the city of Pripyat, several hours of real-life negotiations between dispatchers of the <strong>Chernobyl</strong> power plant, as well as fire brigades, have been added to the game.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WISHLIST</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out more about what really happened in April 1986 in the city of <strong>Pripyat</strong>. And don't forget to add <strong>I MUST FIND HER</strong> to your <u><strong>WISHLIST</strong></u> to keep up to date with the news about the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "April 27, 1986 — during the mass evacuation of the city of Pripyat, a bus convoy with residents of the city disappears. Oleg Suvorov goes in search of the missing convoy to FIND his little daughter, who was on one of the missing buses", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/5e390dae6acfd58f744f08593697bacc5e3b2bd5/header.jpg?t=1780425171", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/a873f02497e700a1d626e85d7ad4dcb301968dbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780425171", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304540/a873f02497e700a1d626e85d7ad4dcb301968dbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780425171", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 4930K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><